flowchart TD
    A["Linux root and architecture checks; require tools and recognized root"]
    B["Resolve latest release and exact asset URLs; validate tag and version metadata"]
    C["Verify archive size and SHA-256 from release checksum"]
    D["Extract sender as nobody; check ELF architecture; execute its staging validator as nobody then root"]
    E["Validator checks archive members, manifest identity and executable hash; check staged sender version"]
    F{"Detected native PVE host"}
    G["Require x64, no conflicting Docker sender; prepare PVE configuration"]
    H["If systemctl exists, check native service state; otherwise continue uninspected; require or install Docker and Compose"]
    I["Preserve existing MQTT settings or prompt for new settings"]
    J["Back up deployment files; pin existing Docker image when applicable"]
    K["Install staged sender and inputs; run compiled install controller"]
    L{"Activation remains stable"}
    M["Commit marker and remove backup; failures before native commit or through Docker marker write attempt recovery; failed recovery retains backup and image; native marker failure preserves installation and backup"]
    N["Windows requires elevated 64-bit x64 PowerShell and trusted paths and ACLs"]
    O["Resolve public release; verify helper scripts and ZIP against release SHA-256 records"]
    P["Validate ZIP paths, sizes, manifest, executable hash and PE architecture; match release identity"]
    Q["Check runtime prerequisites; preserve or create protected MQTT settings"]
    R["Replace recognized package and scheduled task; download pinned LHM via GitHub asset API and verify SHA-256; reuse PawnIO 2.0 or newer or download and verify pinned version; start SYSTEM task"]
    S["Check task remains running; commit marker; on failure restore package and task, retain recovery data if rollback fails"]
    T["Compose builds and starts Docker image; image copies compiled sender into pinned Debian image with hardware utilities"]
    U["Private development install.sh Docker path requires compiled sender at repository root; Windows task scripts remain available"]
    V["Public documentation points to source installers in the main repository; separate release repository is retired"]
    W["Checksums and metadata are release inputs, not independent signatures"]
    X["Stop on failed checks or preparation; earlier side effects can remain"]
    Y["Detect target; create or verify recognized root and acquire installation lock"]
    A --> B
    B --> C
    C --> D
    D --> E
    E --> Y
    Y --> F
    F -->|yes| G
    G --> I
    F -->|no| H
    H --> I
    I --> J
    J --> K
    K -->|native PVE| L
    K -->|Docker| T
    T --> L
    L -->|yes or failure| M
    N --> O
    O --> P
    P --> Q
    Q --> R
    R --> S
    B --> W
    O --> W
    C -->|failure| X
    E -->|failure| X
    G -->|failure| X
    H -->|failure| X
    P -->|failure| X
    Q -->|failure| X
